   "notes": "Built parametrically from published numbers, not from LANG CAD: 130 x 77 x 65 mm overall, jaw width 77 mm, base body 38 mm and jaw top 62 mm above the vise's bottom face (drawing 48120-77 p.3; clamping studs 22 mm below), clamping range 0-120 mm (6-70 mm jaws forward), 14,000 N at 60 Nm, standard clamping depth / support height 3 mm on a pre-stamped blank (form-fit, 6 mm serration pitch). Jaw thickness (12 mm) is scaled from the drawing, not a published number. The stock rests on the jaws' 3 mm step, so the jaw top is 3 mm above the stock bottom. Quick-Point 52 single plate 45150: 150 x 116 x 27 mm. The riser to the C-table is modelled to keep the table at the pack's Z-5.5."
  },
